  "document": "Clayton Beddoes\nClayton Beddoes (born November 10, 1970) is a Canadian ice hockey coach and former professional ice hockey centre. He played two seasons in the National Hockey League. He is currently serving as head coach of the Italy men's national ice hockey team and as assistant coach at ERC Ingolstadt."
